<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-SBC Warburg up ICI to &quot;add&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SBC Warburg up ICI to &quot;add&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at SBC Warburg raised their recommendation on shares in Imperial Chemical Industries Plc (ICI) to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on Friday, market sources said.</p>
<p>ICI shares were weaker in a falling market, down 5-1/2p at 742 by 1351 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at SBC Warburg were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
